xt", "x": 424.73, "y": 964, "width": 355.12, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6b7480", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1407543819, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1072090969, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "단축키는 기본값 · 설정 파일에서 바꿀 수 있음", "originalText": "단축키는 기본값 · 설정 파일에서 바꿀 수 있음", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0075", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1030, "width": 520, "height": 168, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#3b6fd8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 849613033, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1899842599, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "el0076", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 1046, "width": 101.59, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#3b6fd8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1963975987, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1380513882, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "자율 주행", "originalText": "자율 주행", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0077", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 1088, "width": 337.41, "height": 67.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 985376853, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 306814402, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 화면을 스스로 돌아다님, 벽 앞에서 드리프트\n· 트랙이 있으면 트랙 주변만 따라 달림\n· 닫힌 선은 계속 돌고, 열린 선은 끝에서 U턴", "originalText": "· 화면을 스스로 돌아다님, 벽 앞에서 드리프트\n· 트랙이 있으면 트랙 주변만 따라 달림\n· 닫힌 선은 계속 돌고, 열린 선은 끝에서 U턴", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0078", "type": "rectangle", "x": 740.0, "y": 1030, "width": 520, "height": 168, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e53935", "backgroundColor": "#fdecea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 568825840, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 299853839, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "el0079", "type": "text", "x": 762.0, "y": 1046, "width": 101.59, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e53935", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 529628541, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1599851661, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "수동 주행", "originalText": "수동 주행", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0080", "type": "text", "x": 762.0, "y": 1088, "width": 311.73, "height": 67.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1205528894, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1157444917, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 방향키로 운전: 자동차식 / 탑뷰 16방향\n· 가속·관성·브레이크·후진, 부스트 10단\n· miniCar 키만 가로채고 나머지는 그대로", "originalText": "· 방향키로 운전: 자동차식 / 탑뷰 16방향\n· 가속·관성·브레이크·후진, 부스트 10단\n· miniCar 키만 가로채고 나머지는 그대로", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0081", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1420.0, "y": 1030, "width": 520, "height": 168, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2e9e5b", "backgroundColor": "#e6f5ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 564233311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1604199940, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "el0082", "type": "text", "x": 1442.0, "y": 1046, "width": 47.84, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2e9e5b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1255388861, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 920054628, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "주차", "originalText": "주차", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0083", "type": "text", "x": 1442.0, "y": 1088, "width": 234.0, "height": 67.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1928059963, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1253127417, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 비상등 깜빡임, 차는 클릭 통과\n· 방향키 = 차 아래 창을 옮김\n· 최대화된 창은 스크롤", "originalText": "· 비상등 깜빡임, 차는 클릭 통과\n· 방향키 = 차 아래 창을 옮김\n· 최대화된 창은 스크롤", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0084", "type": "arrow", "x": 588, "y": 1090.0, "width": 144.0, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 857706060, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 777381452, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [144.0, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false}, {"id": "el0085", "type": "text", "x": 580, "y": 1052.0, "width": 160.0, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 470987741, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2141740787, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Ctrl+Alt+Shift+M", "originalText": "Ctrl+Alt+Shift+M", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0086", "type": "arrow", "x": 732.0, "y": 1138.0, "width": 144.0, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": 