.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1848510327, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2023854872, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 제자리에 멈춤 (수동 주행이면 자율로 바꾼 뒤)\n· 트레이 아이콘 더블클릭으로도 전환", "originalText": "· 제자리에 멈춤 (수동 주행이면 자율로 바꾼 뒤)\n· 트레이 아이콘 더블클릭으로도 전환", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0100", "type": "rectangle", "x": 740.0, "y": 1330, "width": 520, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffb300", "backgroundColor": "#fff6dc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 24655305, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1460897492, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "el0101", "type": "text", "x": 762.0, "y": 1346, "width": 349.25, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffb300", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1547738333, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 245997990, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "트랙 그리기   Ctrl+Alt+Shift+T", "originalText": "트랙 그리기   Ctrl+Alt+Shift+T", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0102", "type": "text", "x": 762.0, "y": 1388, "width": 212.44, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1463961868, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1900068735, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 화면을 옅게 덮고 차는 멈춤\n· 끝내기: Esc 또는 같은 키", "originalText": "· 화면을 옅게 덮고 차는 멈춤\n· 끝내기: Esc 또는 같은 키", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0103", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1420.0, "y": 1330, "width": 520, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#138a9e", "backgroundColor": "#e3f4f7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1153135003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1612497801, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "el0104", "type": "text", "x": 1442.0, "y": 1346, "width": 271.42, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#138a9e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 573002725, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1650553202, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "숨김   Ctrl+Alt+Shift+V", "originalText": "숨김   Ctrl+Alt+Shift+V", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0105", "type": "text", "x": 1442.0, "y": 1388, "width": 320.44, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f3744", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1376454986, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 730521272, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 차·트랙·안내 모두 사라짐, 트레이만 남음\n· 이 키만 기다림 → 숨기기 전 상태로 복귀", "originalText": "· 차·트랙·안내 모두 사라짐, 트레이만 남음\n· 이 키만 기다림 → 숨기기 전 상태로 복귀", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0106", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1504, "width": 753.81, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6b7480", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 239556469, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 630286725, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "전체 화면 앱(게임·발표·동영상)이 뜨면 자동으로 숨고, 끝나면 다시 나타납니다 (HideOnFullscreen).", "originalText": "전체 화면 앱(게임·발표·동영상)이 뜨면 자동으로 숨고, 끝나면 다시 나타납니다 (HideOnFullscreen).", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el0107", "type": "ellipse", "x": 60, "y": 1564, "width": 46, "height": 46, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e2a3a", "backgroundColor": "#1e2a3a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 933651278, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 339641190, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795588177001, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "el0108", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1572, "width": 46, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 974364242, "version": 1, "ve